@startuml component-system-context
!include style.puml
title TyPy in its environment

actor "Application developer" as Developer
actor "Compiler contributor" as Contributor
actor "Tool integrator" as Integrator

component "typy" as Typy <<system>>

node "C toolchain" as Toolchain
node "C libraries" as CLibraries
node "CPython 3.12 to 3.15" as Oracle
artifact "Executable or library" as Output

Developer --> Typy : check, build, run
Integrator --> Typy : check with JSON diagnostics
Contributor --> Oracle : compares TyPy output with
Contributor --> Typy : emit stage output
Typy --> Toolchain : link command
Toolchain --> CLibraries : links
Toolchain --> Output : writes
@enduml
